<title>JAPAN: Dollar maintains small gains vs yen by late Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Dollar maintains small gains vs yen by late Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>0629 GMT	    TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0600 GMT</p>
<p> USD/JPY     116.24/29		116.29-115.95</p>
<p> USD/DEM     1.8343/48		1.8367-1.8317</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The dollar maintained small gains versus the yen by late afternoon Tokyo on Friday, but the absence of market-moving news kept it within a tight range throughout the session.</p>
<p>&quot;Dollar-bullish sentiment remained intact, but activity was very slow ahead of the weekend. Most players were on the sidelines,&quot; said a trader at a trust bank.</p>
</text>
